		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">DIN-rail power supply, 1-phase AC input, 24 V DC 10 A, 240 W, 63 mm wide</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">DC OK LED and V ADJ output voltage trimmer on the front; DC OK relay contact on terminals 13 and 14 (contact numbering assumed); terminal order of the symbol is a convention, the physical order depends on the series</elementInformation>
